{"data": {"__GLOBAL": {"_ATTACH_BASE_VIEW": "img.nga.cn/attachments"}, "__U": {"60916468": {"uid": 60916468, "username": "UID:60916468", "credit": 135537216, "medal": "272", "reputation": "61_671,128_1005,147_15", "groupid": -1, "memberid": 39, "avatar": null, "yz": 4, "site": null, "honor": null, "regdate": 1567950654, "mute_time": null, "postnum": 3672, "rvrc": 12, "money": 19999, "thisvisit": 1788235078, "signature": null, "nickname": null, "bit_data": 135537216, "group_bit_buf": 2048, "buffs": {"129": [[1581016, 129, 0, 60916468, 1786152653, 1788916286, 2048, 0]]}}, "150058": {"uid": 150058, "username": "UID:150058", "credit": 135537154, "medal": "272,207,157,92", "reputation": "28_30,61_0,147_775,130_10", "groupid": -1, "memberid": 73, "avatar": null, "yz": 4, "site": null, "honor": null, "regdate": 1123989606, "mute_time": null, "postnum": 42229, "rvrc": 29, "money": 90765, "thisvisit": 1788178932, "signature": null, "nickname": null, "bit_data": 135537154}, "__GROUPS": {"39": ["学徒", 98528, 39], "73": ["学徒", 360672, 73]}, "__MEDALS": {"272": ["272.gif", "棒棒糖", "叔叔请你吃棒棒糖", 272], "207": ["207.gif", "爆竹声中旧岁除", "一支红杏出墙来", 207], "157": ["157.gif", "王者之剑", "王者之剑活动纪念", 157], "92": ["92.gif", "小心死亡之翼-", "2011年大灾变开服纪念", 92]}, "__REPUTATIONS": {"147": {"60916468": 15, "150058": 775, "0": "大时代"}}}, "__R": [{"pid": 879484190, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 18, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 18:39", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879481990,47288722,1386]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=60640426]圣光掌握者[/uid] (2026-08-24 18:15):[/b]<br/><br/>兔佬 像您请教个问题 现在没有新资金入场，里面被套的资金也不愿割肉，就是极致的缩量磨盘，直到量越来越小  然后发起冲锋把场外资金再吸进来再来一波大闷杀[/quote]<br/><br/>有一个问题:你构建了一个缩量磨到极致之后会向上变盘的假设，请问这个假设是基于什么逻辑下成立的，为什么不是向下变盘？如果向上变盘谁来拉？<br/><br/>感觉应该只能靠长期投资信念的多头资金来做这件事情，但目前我只看到超短套利资金", "lou": 120, "content_length": 214, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879481990, "postdatetimestamp": 1787567992}, {"pid": 879507029, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 45, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-24 23:52", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "这段时间麻袋什么时候装过钱，装的全特么是家人", "lou": 121, "content_length": 44, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787586762}, {"pid": 879524033, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 43, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 09:02", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "死便死了，我们要有骨气，不能让人看不起", "lou": 122, "content_length": 38, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787619724}, {"pid": 879525363, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 64, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 09:13", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "今天再往下一根，4-5都快他妈走完了，哪还有诱多，都快去打ma365了，你们还在狗队，狗个毛啊，他不托还好，今天托一下，不就是不跌大盘跌科技，还要多挨好多天的打<br/><br/>现在让我吃史我忍了，但是你最好真的有大五", "lou": 123, "content_length": 192, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787620392}, {"pid": 879526430, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 31, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 09:22", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "理论上今天大低开是机会，但是我已经不愿意买了，走的太恶心了，要杀就杀透吧，别磨了", "lou": 124, "content_length": 80, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787620930}, {"pid": 879532310, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 39, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 10:07", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "这波就算缩量抽上去了，又能怎么样呢？<br/><br/>盘面已经走坏了，现在就是在走4-5，缩量不是没人割，而是场外资金没人买", "lou": 125, "content_length": 103, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787623629}, {"pid": 879532434, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 15, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 10:07", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879532355,47288722,1414]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67138111]Altyport[/uid] (2026-08-25 10:07):[/b]<br/><br/>连存储都在猛拉，只有 170 还在跌[/quote]<br/><br/>补跌zsbd", "lou": 126, "content_length": 13, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879532355, "postdatetimestamp": 1787623678}, {"pid": 879533852, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 7, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 10:19", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879533734,47288722,1419]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=150058]-阿狼-[/uid] (2026-08-25 10:18):[/b]<br/><br/>所以不用神话我  我今天没敢抄就是没敢抄<br/>除了那种我提前很久就定好计划的  完全无关盘面的操作我才做进去<br/>今天但凡看短期的我一个子都没抄进去。<br/>我能不割肉已经算定力了。[/quote]<br/><br/>狼大这里看下跌中继，还是短期阶段底？", "lou": 127, "content_length": 41, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879533734, "postdatetimestamp": 1787624347}, {"pid": 879534192, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 26, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 10:21", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "这里我目前的判断是下跌中继，因为没有持续放量，想请教一下狼头看法", "lou": 128, "content_length": 64, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787624483}, {"pid": 879534371, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 5, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 10:22", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879534270,47288722,1421]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=150058]-阿狼-[/uid] (2026-08-25 10:21):[/b]<br/><br/>昨天的延续<br/>没什么问题  这里还是看反弹之后的诱多<br/>我不可能买进去看下跌中继<br/>我不是那样的人，我只是怕了 不是傻了。[/quote]<br/><br/>感谢狼大", "lou": 129, "content_length": 13, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879534270, "postdatetimestamp": 1787624563}, {"pid": 879534564, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 25, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 10:24", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "如果参考狼头理解，那么这里，如果能突破3882.8并且企稳，会构成一个火中取栗的短期右侧买点", "lou": 130, "content_length": 86, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787624660}, {"pid": 879535537, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 21, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 10:31", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "这里被3882.8反压，我觉得如果午盘之前无法突破过去，我还是会维持我之前偏空的盘面判断，也就是这里是下跌中继<br/><br/>我昨天尾盘是动了手的，今天原本也是看修复，但是盘面走成这样，也只能尊重市场", "lou": 131, "content_length": 178, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787625099}, {"pid": 879537280, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 2, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 10:43", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879535591,47288722,1424]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=63327317]leke10[/uid] (2026-08-25 10:31):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大请教下，27号凌晨是达子财报，这里不需要减仓规避下吗，假设财报不及预期，会不会有个大跌来了[/quote]<br/><br/>财报如果只是小超预期，导致外围大跌，那么我们这里对应低开我是必抄的", "lou": 132, "content_length": 71, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879535591, "postdatetimestamp": 1787625831}, {"pid": 879537590, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 42, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 10:46", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "谁来了不得赞一句熊来<br/><br/>[s:ac:茶]涨得时候不见你这么凶，哦，也不能这么说，把散户甩飞之后急不可耐恨不得天天拉板的样子还是很帅的", "lou": 133, "content_length": 110, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787625968}, {"pid": 879538676, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 41, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 10:54", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879537960,47288722,1427]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=62679027]Llithlying[/uid] (2026-08-25 10:48):[/b]<br/><br/>兔佬怎么回事[s:pg:拒绝]你之前那么淡定的，大家都指望看你们大佬的了，怎么最近有点情趣化了[/quote]<br/><br/>我很情绪化吗，我自己确实没有意识到，可能确实有一点，感谢提醒<br/><br/>这个盘面走的太难看了，我看盘看的非常不爽，可能影响到你们了，我现在更换了一下策略评估模型，基本上把每种可能性中最差的那个方向作为第一优先级，结果居然次次能和盘面对应上，真的有点气笑了", "lou": 134, "content_length": 247, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879537960, "postdatetimestamp": 1787626454}, {"pid": 879539816, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 22, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 11:01", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879538676,47288722,1428]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=60916468]灰兔尾[/uid] (2026-08-25 10:54):[/b]<br/><br/>我很情绪化吗，我自己确实没有意识到，可能确实有一点，感谢提醒<br/><br/>这个盘面走的太难看了，我看盘看的非常不爽，可能影响到你们了，我现在更换了一下策略评估模型，基本上把每种可能性中最差的那个方向作为第一优先级，结果居然次次能和盘面对应上，真的有点气笑了[/quote]<br/><br/>我七八月份基本上连做到现在，可能确实积蓄了不少情绪压力，我自己都没有完全意识到，真心感谢楼里朋友提醒<br/><br/>我今天看着那个3882的昨日反抽高点被反压掉，上方就是均线，那一刻真的有点被气到，都这样了还是做不出底，那就是要走加速下跌段的感觉了，今天情绪化发言比较多，我自己也应该反省一下，各位见笑了", "lou": 135, "content_length": 289, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879538676, "postdatetimestamp": 1787626895}, {"pid": 879555858, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 5, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 13:18", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "什么消息，没看懂", "lou": 136, "content_length": 16, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787635112}, {"pid": 879556161, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 26, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 13:21", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "不是说没有韩国因子，量化不影响市场吗[s:ac:汗]这市场里面真的还有活人吗", "lou": 137, "content_length": 58, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787635308}, {"pid": 879556749, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 35, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 13:27", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "这玩的实在太恶心了[s:ac:嘲笑1]本来你们今天说我情绪化，我还认真反省一下自己，现在感觉是应该情绪化一点，哪有这么玩的，这不纯恶心人吗<br/><br/>真有点不知道怎么下手，三根15k过3885就动手？", "lou": 138, "content_length": 159, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787635677}, {"pid": 879557111, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 19, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 13:31", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879556928